[h1]v0.2.4 - Tracked and armoured vehicles no longer crawl off-road[/h1]

[h2]What you need to do[/h2]
[list]
[*]ZombieBuddy (option A): nothing, Steam updates the mod.
[*]Manual install (option B): this update changes the Java, so copy the files from [b]B42.21_Manual_Install[/b] into the game again.
[/list]

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Fixed: slow vehicles launched far too slowly on grass and dirt.[/b] Vehicles whose script top speed is low, like the tracked M113, M163 and M41 from Papa Chad's mods (top speed 25), spun their wheels away the moment the ground gave a little and then barely moved: 7-10 km/h after 3 seconds on grass. They now do 18-22 and reach their top speed after 5 seconds, like on the road. Only vehicles with a top speed under 60 km/h are affected; every car is unchanged.
[/list]

[h2]Good to know[/h2]
[list]
[*]The M1A1 Abrams and the M998 Humvee were not stuck: they accelerate on road and grass, a bit slower than vanilla, which is how BVD tunes every car.
[*]The tracked vehicles stay close to the 25 km/h their mods script as top speed (about 28). Vanilla ignores that value and lets them go past 40. If you want them faster, tell me.
[/list]

Thanks to the player who reported it.
